// Hair, drawn over the head (body/base) in the hair slot (h light, i mid, j dark), lit from the upper left.
// 25 x 35 (CHARS-B, 2026-10-10): the cap is the head plus one pixel each side (outline at cols 4 and 20), tips reach
// row 1 at most, and the fringe ends above the eyes (row 14). Hair reuses the standing frame for its steps, so each
// style draws down, up and left only. Solid ink silhouettes must tell the six townspeople styles apart.

// Short and tidy, a side-parted fringe (Hollis, Mira, Orin, Nym, Nix).
sprite hair/short 25 35

